    <item>
      <title>Mac Resource Monitor 1.2.1</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li>Storage Volumes no longer lists mounted disk images (DMGs) or other non-physical/read-only volumes — only real drives now appear.</li>
          <li>Redesigned dashboard layout: wider default window, a balanced card grid (no more orphaned Thermal card), and content that stays centered instead of stretching awkwardly on large displays.</li>
          <li>Reworked the Local Inference view to spread horizontally with consistent card heights and far less vertical scrolling on laptops.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 20:05:04 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
